{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Knight of The Kingdom&quot; is an action-adventure RPG that immerses you in a dark and mysterious world. A dense, dark mist has engulfed the village, bringing terrifying creatures that sow chaos in their wake. As the protagonist, your mission is to uncover the origin of this mist, face monsters, and survive in a hostile environment where danger lurks at every turn. Explore, fight, and discover the secrets of a kingdom where the mist is only the beginning of a dark threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STUNNING CINEMATIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/7b4ccfbcca7d2498128cb353070190c7.poster.avif?t=1762091442\" width=400 height=710 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/7b4ccfbcca7d2498128cb353070190c7.webm?t=1762091442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/7b4ccfbcca7d2498128cb353070190c7.mp4?t=1762091442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/e95a38abdae9414887781089fd35c2f8.poster.avif?t=1762091442\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/e95a38abdae9414887781089fd35c2f8.webm?t=1762091442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325870/extras/e95a38abdae9414887781089fd35c2f8.mp4?t=1762091442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr